# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of the committing
# machine's core.autocrlf setting. This repo is published to npm verbatim
# (index.js + templates/**) — CRLF sneaking into a commit corrupts generated
# scaffolds (mixed CRLF/LF within a single file breaks PHP_CodeSniffer's
# tokenizer) and diverges from what's checked into GitHub.
* text=auto eol=lf
